flowchart TD
    begin([Move starts]) --> target[Convert the position to steps and set the target]
    target --> arrived{On the target?}
    arrived -->|Yes| finished([Finished])
    arrived -->|No| limit{Switch pressed?}
    limit -->|Yes| fault[Stop the axis and raise a fault]
    limit -->|No| stopped{Stopped early?}
    stopped -->|Yes| fault
    stopped -->|No, next pass| arrived
    fault --> aborted([Aborted])
